    {
      "key": "end.comment.0",
      "value": "Grass cut. Hay baled. Existential dread: pending."
    },
    {
      "key": "end.comment.1",
      "value": "The field is clear. Whether your conscience is — that's between you and the grass."
    },
    {
      "key": "end.comment.2",
      "value": "Somewhere, a cow is grateful. The cow would not say this out loud."
    },
    {
      "key": "end.comment.3",
      "value": "They said it couldn't be done. They were wrong. We don't know who 'they' are."
    },
    {
      "key": "end.comment.4",
      "value": "Job done. Whatever that means."
    },
    {
      "key": "end.comment.5",
