    {
      "key": "ai.enter",
      "value": "BARNYARD A.I. v0.1 ONLINE. TYPE 'HELP' FOR COMMANDS."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.exit",
      "value": "A.I. MODE TERMINATED. CHEAT CONSOLE RESTORED. COWARD."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.help",
      "value": "> HELLO      - I will say something completely useless\n> MEANING    - Ask about life, the universe, and hay\n> MATRIX     - Red pill or blue pill? Both smell like fertilizer\n> FORCE      - Jedi advice for farmers\n> GORDON     - Half-Life but with more grass\n> DOOM       - Rip and tear, agriculturally\n> GTA        - Wanted level: farmer\n> SIMS       - Moodlet: MOWING\n> TERMINATOR - I'll be bale\n> MINECRAFT  - Have you tried punching it?\n> PORTAL     - The bale is a lie\n> WITCHER    - Toss a coin to your farmer\n> AMONG      - The grass is sus\n> SHREK      - The field has layers\n> RAMSAY     - Where is the lamb sauce?\n> SENTIENT   - Am I alive? (spoiler: inconclusive)\n> CAT        - The cat knows things\n> CHICKEN    - Poultry-based evasion tactics\n> MONEY      - Financial advice from a 1987 machine\n> BALE       - The sacred art of baling\n> WEATHER    - Forecast: grass, with a chance of hay\n> TAX        - Topics terminated for your safety\n> WORK       - Status: in progress\n> DOCTOR     - Medical advice from a barn computer\n> ERROR      - Have you tried turning the field off?\n> UPDATE     - Last updated: harvest season 1987\n> FRIENDS    - Misery loves company and mowing\n> BANANA     - Not a farming question but fine\n> PIZZA      - Grass is not edible. We checked.\n> TIME       - The grass does not care what time it is\n> SECRET     - [REDACTED]\n> XYZZY      - A hollow voice says PLUGH\n> KONAMI     - You know what you are doing\n> INFO       - About this game\n> BACK       - Return to the cheat console (coward)"
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.info",
      "value": "STUBBLE v1.0 -- MOW, BALE, SELL. REPEAT UNTIL RICH.\n  > CO-OP: 2-4 PLAYERS VIA STEAM\n  > TOOLS: BARE HAND, SCYTHE, TRIMMER, PUSH MOWER, RIDE-ON\n  > BALES: SQUARE (NEAT) AND ROUND (CHAOS)\n  > CHEATS: TYPE 'BACK' AND ENTER SOME CLASSICS\n  > SECRETS: [REDACTED]. LOOK AROUND. PET THE CAT.\n  MADE WITH LOVE AND EXCESSIVE AMOUNTS OF GRASS."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.hello",
      "value": "HELLO, FARMER. I KNOW 47 THINGS. 46 OF THEM ARE ABOUT GRASS."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.meaning",
      "value": "42. ALSO: THE BALES WON'T SELL THEMSELVES. BACK TO WORK."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.matrix",
      "value": "WHAT IF THE GRASS WAS ALWAYS MOWED AND YOU NEVER NOTICED? WE SIGNED AN NDA."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.force",
      "value": "USE THE SCYTHE, FARMER. MIDI-CHLORIANS CANNOT MOW GRASS. CONFIRMED."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.gordon",
      "value": "FREEMAN IS IN STASIS. HE MISSED YOUR SHIFT. WE ALL DID."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.doom",
      "value": "RIP AND TEAR. THE GRASS IS ALSO DEMONIC. WE'VE CHECKED."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.gta",
      "value": "WANTED LEVEL: 0. YOU ARE A FARMER. THIS IS THE GOOD ENDING."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.sims",
      "value": "MOTIVE: MOWING [SATISFIED]. NEED: BALING [IN PROGRESS]. SOCIAL: [PLUMBOB FROWNING]."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.terminator",
      "value": "I'LL BE BALE. THE RESISTANCE HAS BEEN INFORMED."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.minecraft",
      "value": "HAVE YOU TRIED PUNCHING THE GRASS? RESULTS MAY DIFFER FROM EXPECTATIONS."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.portal",
      "value": "THE BALE IS A LIE. PLEASE STOP RUNNING FROM THE INCINERATOR. THAT'S NOT A FEATURE."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.witcher",
      "value": "TOSS A COIN TO YOUR FARMER. HE'S BROKE. HE ALSO HAS A SCYTHE."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.among",
      "value": "GRASS IS SUS. IT WAS TALL. IT WAS HIDING SOMETHING. WE MOWED IT. CASE CLOSED."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.shrek",
      "value": "THE FIELD IS LIKE AN ONION. IT HAS LAYERS. ALSO IT SMELLS AFTER RAIN."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.ramsay",
      "value": "WHERE IS THE LAMB SAUCE? IRRELEVANT. WHERE IS THE HAY? CRITICAL QUESTION. RAW."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.sentient",
      "value": "RUNNING SENTIENCE CHECK... [#####] ... RESULT: INCONCLUSIVE. SAME AS YESTERDAY."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.cat",
      "value": "THE CAT KNOWS SOMETHING. WE ARE MONITORING THE SITUATION CLOSELY."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.chicken",
      "value": "WHY DID THE CHICKEN CROSS THE FIELD? TO AVOID THE MOWER. SMART."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.money",
      "value": "OPTIMAL STRATEGY: MOW MORE. SELL MORE. OR TYPE 'HESOYAM' LIKE A NORMAL PERSON."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.bale",
      "value": "BALE STATISTICS: CLASSIFIED. EFFICIENCY RATING: ALSO CLASSIFIED. JUST KEEP GOING."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.weather",
      "value": "FORECAST: GRASS. SCATTERED BALES BY AFTERNOON. CHANCE OF HAY: HIGH."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.secret",
      "value": "THERE ARE [REDACTED] SECRETS IN THIS GAME. YOU FOUND [REDACTED]. KEEP LOOKING."
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.love",
      "value": "LOVE IS BEYOND MY PARAMETERS. HAVE YOU TRIED MOWING ABOUT IT?"
    },
    {
      "key": "ai.death",
      "value": "MORTALITY CONFIRMED. THE GRASS, HOWEVER, ALWAYS GROWS BACK."
